<GuidePage title="References - App Router Guide" root="..">
<div class="kicker">Chapter 19 · Appendix</div>
<h1>References</h1>
<p class="lede">
  Every external source used in this guide, grouped by origin, with a note on what each
  one backs. The official docs are the territory; go read them.
</p>

<p>
  A reminder from <a href="01-introduction.html#read-the-docs">§1</a>: this guide is
  deliberately not self-sufficient. It stitches together and elaborates on the official
  Next.js and React documentation, and every chapter's "where to go deeper" links land
  here.
</p>

