<h2 id="talks">19.3 Talks and essays</h2>
<p>
  The primary sources for the "voices" table in
  <a href="01-introduction.html#direction">§1</a>: the platform's authors saying
  server-first out loud, on the record, across a decade.
</p>
<ul>
  <li>
    <a
      href="https://rauchg.com/2014/7-principles-of-rich-web-applications"
      target="_blank"
      rel="noopener"
      >7 Principles of Rich Web Applications</a
